---
title: Benefits & Giving Levels
description: Rocket Fund benefits begin at $100 a year and climb from there — priority seating, premium parking, and Joe Grogan Room access at Savage Arena.
sidearmSlug: rocket-fund-benefits
cleanUrl: utrockets.com/rocketfundbenefits
crumb: []
---
{% from "components.njk" import hero, sechead, ctaband %}

{% call hero("Benefits & levels", "Gain altitude", "Benefits and privileges begin at $100 of annual support and increase with your level of giving.", true) %}
<div class="rkt-btnrow">
  <a class="rkt-btn" href="/give/">Give Now</a>
</div>
{% endcall %}

<section class="rkt-section">
  <div class="rkt-wrap">
    {{ sechead(
      "The flight path",
      "Giving levels",
      "Your total annual giving to the Rocket Fund sets your level. Each level carries every benefit below it."
    ) }}
    <ol class="rkt-bands">
      {% for level in levels %}
      <li class="rkt-band{% if level.featured %} rkt-band--featured{% endif %} rkt-reveal">
        <p class="rkt-band-amount">{{ level.amount }}<span class="rkt-per">{{ level.per }}</span></p>
        <div>
          <div class="rkt-band-name">
            <h3 class="rkt-h3">{{ level.name }}</h3>
            {% if level.featured %}<span class="rkt-chip rkt-chip--gold">Most popular</span>{% endif %}
            {% if level.sample %}<span class="rkt-chip">Sample — to be confirmed</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <ul>
            {% for b in level.benefits %}
            <li>{{ b }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <p class="rkt-note">Preview note: levels marked "sample" are placeholders pending confirmation by Athletic Development. The Gold ($600) and Executive ($1,200) benefits shown reflect current program materials.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rkt-section rkt-section--dark">
  <div class="rkt-wrap">
    <div class="rkt-prose rkt-reveal">
      {{ sechead("Parking & hospitality", "How assignments work") }}
      <p>All donors receive a season parking pass, with the parking area assigned by your total giving level — Gold-level donors ($600+) qualify for a Lot 10 pass for football, and premium placement improves as you climb.</p>
      <p>At Savage Arena, the Joe Grogan Room is open to all Gold-level donors for men's and women's basketball, with pregame table reservations for Executive-level donors ($1,200+).</p>
      <div class="rkt-btnrow">
        <a class="rkt-btn" href="/premium/">Premium seating &amp; parking</a>
        <a class="rkt-btn rkt-btn--ghost" href="/faq/">Benefits FAQ</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{ ctaband("Set your cruising altitude.", "/give/", "Give Now", "/contact/", "Ask about levels") }}
